usage: tetriz-connectors sync [flags]

Run one operation for one organization now and print the run as JSON. Exits 1 when the run fails.

Flags:
  -connector string
    	connector id, for example github (required)
  -op string
    	operation id, for example fetch_prs (required)
  -org string
    	organization id, a UUID (required)
  -tenant string
    	tenant kind: organization or individual (default "organization")
